ce fantasy, science fiction, sci-fi, sex, sick, sound sculptures, Space Adventure, space, spazmos of mojo county, spazmo, speculative, speculative fiction, splatter, Steve Carter, Steve Carter\u0092s Comic Nasties, strange creatures, strange, surreal, surrealism, swords, TeknoSadist, torture, tragicomedy, transgressive, underground, violence, warrior women, weird evolution, weird, weird art gags, wild, wordplay, </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-02T09:48:16-08:00","id":778403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/773235-the-best-worst-1st-ed-messes-in-wta?p=778172#post778172\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In case anyones interested in what the SCAR duo are up to these days. I mostly remember their comic work from the back of soft-core mags like Picture and People back in the day.<br /> <a href=\"http://www.weirdwildart.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.weirdwildart.com</a></div> </div> </div> </div>JOY<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.weirdwildart.com/images/Femsar2A.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Why didn't we get these folks in on illustrating CB20 or Shattered Dreams?<br /> That's some good shit right there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-02T13:11:02-08:00","id":778546,"title":"","content":"I suppose it's not the worst art I've ever seen in a RPG product. (HERO Games' <i>The Atlantean Age</i> had art that I swear looked like someone's kid brought it home from kindergarten to pin on the refrigerator.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-02T16:00:54-08:00","id":778660,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I don't mind SCAR that much in their proper context. They ooze the underground comic scene of the 80s-90s. It's just that they really didn't fit to Werewolf as well.<br /> <br /> On a related note, Rage across Australia offers us these three BSD metis;<br /> <br /> -BSD metis male who is fertile and his stick is knocking women up.<br /> <br /> -BSD metis ragabash with 6 rage and 1 willpower.<br /> <br /> -BSD metis female who apparently is pregnant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-03T06:56:05-08:00","id":778972,"title":"","content":"Rage across Australia also gave us the Rainbow Serpent bleeding on Bunyip ghosts and resurrecting them as well as purified Black Spiral Dancers...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}